 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZxpIWimB4-IQ7kNvwGbqOKO&_nc_oc=Adp6ID3-nWegkccG_-mf_AuOuDgnQEtIIzjG6_j0C8E8WPbz8cs61I6kGz6uFcfXNZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRN7s8gcq1S6bAj5fEUGNJfj2-40ySQ8TNbPotb3VIgSA&oe=6B0C5F54"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CW027azyTCcQ7kNvwEfzuRY&_nc_oc=AdpCiHLIvEQkvChhBfANjIj9VteX9X8OcmHHmJ60fqS7F72HE1uQnBIWlfgGN8n4h-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQToXMgpFCHibz-A3jCWGrqey56DnqvEac4or_y43GZlZw&oe=6B0C559D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XMr3s49LRJkQ7kNvwGI7LVH&_nc_oc=AdrqA7r1k_5thNs6P4D9r607oT_d7fam2_QjmfBO19tDZzzLT2bHxYtWt94n0VmPbCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQVrn1y4kw83IF4eCkWVWdoiahkPXiWkbxdBVmsR2wiAw&oe=6B0C81F4"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2